RX of every node during tests 01 and 02 (2026-10-10, three r7525 servers, library and tests as in this directory)

While the unchanged test ran, each node sampled port_rcv_data of mlx5_0, mlx5_2 and mlx5_3 every 5 ms. The samples
are split at the iteration boundaries that rank 0 prints, and the split of node-1 agrees with the test's own
per-iteration counters ("test" column) within 2 MB. MB = 2^20 bytes, received over all three NICs of a node.

